
Diagram-As-Code:             https://diagrams.mingrammer.com/   
Usage:                       Pass Diagram-as-code text to 'app.py' and run 'docker compose up python'
Output:                      Image in local directory


D2:                          https://d2lang.com/
Usage:                       Create 'diagram.d2' and run 'docker compose up d2'
Output:                      localhost:5001


